our head is free to look around.\n\nYou got hammers in a game for more fun. \ud83d\udd28\n\nIn first version you play Maze Out. \nTry to exit from a compact maze full of monsters. Use hammers to hit monsters and other players. \nLoot Hoins from air drops or other players. \n\nFind a key and exit the maze to earn rewards. This maze out is chaotic with your friends. ", "short_description": "Hammer Heads is a FUN & CRAZY multiplayer game. \nRace, Escape, Defend, Battle Royale, Co-Op with / or against friends or random players online.\n\nWalk, Jog or Run around as a human using hand movements but NOT USING JOYSTICKS\nNEW - You move forward in direction of your body not HEAD and your head is free to look around\n\nYou got hammers in a game for more fun. \n\nIn first version you play Maze Out. You try to find key while running from monster. This maze out is chaotic with your friends. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dopamindgames.com/index.php/privacy-policy-hammer-heads/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DopaMind Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dopamindgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "6587236461330232"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChanne